"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちがまあやでどっちが生駒ちゃんかわかる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/17/1135472/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！七瀬ちゃんのせいで色んなメンバーにどんな歌にでもまあやの名前を入れて歌われるまあやでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/17/1135472/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\nあと、ミカンのコメントありがとう♪(^o^)\n凄く食べる人もいたからビックリしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/17/1135472/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルーツ風邪予防になるって教えてもらったので、買いに行こう~♪＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜は握手会だぁ~(///ω///)♪\n楽しみ~♪\n気を付けて来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/17/1135472/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式を迎えた かずみん、かりんちゃん、ななつん、ゆったん、まなったん、おめでとうございます♪\nとってもキレイだったよ~(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で、成人になられた方やお誕生日の方等いたら教えて下さい(*^.^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/17/1135472/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/01/17/1135472/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}